WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.300 --> 00:00:03.167
-The Justice Department
has responded

00:00:03.167 --> 00:00:05.167
to Donald Trump's attempt
to get the Supreme Court

00:00:05.167 --> 00:00:06.934
to intervene
in the criminal investigation

00:00:06.934 --> 00:00:08.400
of his stolen
classified documents

00:00:08.400 --> 00:00:11.334
and yet, even as that
criminal case intensifies

00:00:11.334 --> 00:00:12.634
and more evidence emerges,

00:00:12.634 --> 00:00:14.968
Republicans are still
fully onboard

00:00:14.968 --> 00:00:17.467
with Trump and Trump's
handpicked candidates,

00:00:17.467 --> 00:00:19.701
like Herschel Walker,
who's also dealing

00:00:19.701 --> 00:00:22.634
with more bombshell revelations
in his abortion scandal.

00:00:22.634 --> 00:00:24.734
For more on this,
it's time for "A Closer Look."

00:00:24.734 --> 00:00:28.968
♪♪
[ Cheering and applause ]

00:00:28.968 --> 00:00:31.334
The looming midterms have
proven, once again,

00:00:31.334 --> 00:00:33.801
that the Republican Party
still remains fully captive

00:00:33.801 --> 00:00:35.267
to Donald Trump and his cabal.

00:00:35.267 --> 00:00:38.133
In key battleground races
across the country,

00:00:38.133 --> 00:00:39.868
the Republicans running
for House, Senate, governor,

00:00:39.868 --> 00:00:43.000
and even Secretary of State
are pro-Trump, MAGA candidates,

00:00:43.000 --> 00:00:46.467
in many cases, endorsed or even
handpicked by Trump himself.

00:00:46.467 --> 00:00:48.767
And that's never good
because Trump always picks

00:00:48.767 --> 00:00:50.467
the weirdest people he can find,

00:00:50.467 --> 00:00:52.200
[ Laughter ]
like Steve Bannon;

00:00:52.200 --> 00:00:53.501
or the pillow guy;

00:00:53.501 --> 00:00:56.033
or even his own lawyer, a man --

00:00:56.033 --> 00:00:58.100
[ Laughter ]
a man who sweats like he just

00:00:58.100 --> 00:01:01.634
got out of a sauna
after sleeping there overnight.

00:01:01.634 --> 00:01:03.267
[ Laughter ]
[ As Giuliani ]
I had the weirdest dream,

00:01:03.267 --> 00:01:05.100
where I was a 7-Eleven hot dog.

00:01:05.100 --> 00:01:06.734
You know --
[ Laughter ]

00:01:06.734 --> 00:01:08.434
You know, the guy
who wears golf shorts

00:01:08.434 --> 00:01:10.968
that go from his belly button
down to his ankles.

00:01:10.968 --> 00:01:12.634
[ Laughter ]
Like he accidentally bought

00:01:12.634 --> 00:01:14.133
a pair of child's khakis.

00:01:14.133 --> 00:01:15.501
[ Laughter ]
Look at that dude.

00:01:15.501 --> 00:01:18.234
Looks like a 1920s newsie
who got stranded

00:01:18.234 --> 00:01:19.767
on that beach
that makes you old.

00:01:19.767 --> 00:01:20.934
[ As Giuliani ]
Extry! Extry!

00:01:20.934 --> 00:01:22.400
I forgot what I was going
to say.

00:01:22.400 --> 00:01:23.601
[ Laughter ]

00:01:23.601 --> 00:01:25.901
I can make fun of Rudy's
giant shorts all day.

00:01:25.901 --> 00:01:28.200
For example, he looks like he's
in a Disney movie called...

00:01:29.000 --> 00:01:32.234
[ Laughter ]
But I am being tol...d

00:01:32.234 --> 00:01:33.601
that I have to get to the point.

00:01:33.601 --> 00:01:36.667
Alright, well, Trump's latest
handpicked disaster is

00:01:36.667 --> 00:01:39.234
Herschel Walker, the GOP
candidate for Senate in Georgia.

00:01:39.234 --> 00:01:41.400
Trump personally urged Walker
to run,

00:01:41.400 --> 00:01:43.400
despite warnings --
from fellow Republicans,

00:01:43.400 --> 00:01:45.934
it should be noted --
about Walker's troubled past

00:01:45.934 --> 00:01:48.634
and, sure enough, Walker is now
engulfed in a growing scandal,

00:01:48.634 --> 00:01:50.300
which includes
the latest revelation

00:01:50.300 --> 00:01:52.801
that the mother
of one of Walker's children had

00:01:52.801 --> 00:01:55.968
to repeatedly press him to pay
for an abortion he wanted.

00:01:55.968 --> 00:01:57.400
And, much like Trump,
Walker has tried

00:01:57.400 --> 00:01:59.100
to distract
from the mounting scandals

00:01:59.100 --> 00:02:01.300
by doing and saying
some very strange things.

00:02:01.300 --> 00:02:02.601
Yesterday, for example,

00:02:02.601 --> 00:02:04.767
Walker told this
incredibly bizarre story

00:02:04.767 --> 00:02:07.734
about a bull and some cows
at a campaign rally.

00:02:07.734 --> 00:02:10.000
-So I've been telling
this little story

00:02:10.000 --> 00:02:14.334
about this ball
out in the field with six cows

00:02:14.334 --> 00:02:15.968
and three of them are pregnant.

00:02:15.968 --> 00:02:17.100
[ Rally laughter ]

00:02:17.100 --> 00:02:18.934
So you know he got something
going on.

00:02:18.934 --> 00:02:21.701
[ Rally laughter ]
But all he cared about is

00:02:21.701 --> 00:02:23.434
kept his nose against the fence,

00:02:23.434 --> 00:02:26.834
looking at three other cows
that didn't belong to him.

00:02:26.834 --> 00:02:29.267
Now, all he had to do is
eat grass.

00:02:29.267 --> 00:02:31.267
But no, no, no,
he thought something was better

00:02:31.267 --> 00:02:32.501
somewhere else.

00:02:32.501 --> 00:02:35.367
So, he decided,
"I want to get over there."

00:02:35.367 --> 00:02:38.200
So, one day,
he measured that fence up

00:02:38.200 --> 00:02:40.601
and he said,
"I think I can jump this."

00:02:40.601 --> 00:02:43.133
So, that came where he got back.

00:02:43.133 --> 00:02:45.033
And he got back
and, as he took off running,

00:02:45.033 --> 00:02:46.367
he dove over that fence

00:02:46.367 --> 00:02:49.234
and his belly got cut up
under the bottom.

00:02:49.234 --> 00:02:50.934
But as he made it over
on the other side,

00:02:50.934 --> 00:02:54.200
he shook it off
and got so excited about it

00:02:54.200 --> 00:02:55.868
and he ran
to the top of that hill,

00:02:55.868 --> 00:02:57.334
but when he got up there,
he realized

00:02:57.334 --> 00:02:58.534
they were bulls, too.

00:02:58.534 --> 00:02:59.334
[ Laughter ]

00:02:59.334 --> 00:03:00.801
So, what I'm telling you...

00:03:00.801 --> 00:03:02.501
[ Applause ]

00:03:02.501 --> 00:03:05.067
...don't think something is
better somewhere else.

00:03:05.067 --> 00:03:07.868
[ Laughter ]
-Kind of feels like a bad idea
for Herschel Walker

00:03:07.868 --> 00:03:09.100
to be telling any stories

00:03:09.100 --> 00:03:10.801
about multiple
random pregnancies,

00:03:10.801 --> 00:03:12.534
especially one where
the expectant dad

00:03:12.534 --> 00:03:14.200
just peaces out like that.

00:03:14.200 --> 00:03:15.934
[ Laughter ]

00:03:15.934 --> 00:03:17.534
I don't even understand
the logic here.

00:03:17.534 --> 00:03:19.167
A bull got
three cows pregnant,

00:03:19.167 --> 00:03:21.300
then he saw some more cows
on the other side of a fence

00:03:21.300 --> 00:03:24.667
and so he jumped the fence to go
have sex with the other cows,

00:03:24.667 --> 00:03:25.901
but then when he got closer,

00:03:25.901 --> 00:03:28.100
he realized the cows
were actually bulls.

00:03:28.100 --> 00:03:31.801
Are you misremembering
a Sandra Boynton book?

00:03:31.801 --> 00:03:35.033
[ Laughter ]

00:03:35.033 --> 00:03:37.567
Also, I want to revisit
this part of the story.

00:03:37.567 --> 00:03:41.567
-This ball out in the field
with six cows

00:03:41.567 --> 00:03:44.367
and three of them are pregnant.

00:03:44.367 --> 00:03:46.901
So you know he got something
going on.

00:03:46.901 --> 00:03:48.968
-He said that
like it was gossip,

00:03:48.968 --> 00:03:50.667
[ Laughter ]
like the cows --

00:03:50.667 --> 00:03:52.634
the cows were all whispering
to each other

00:03:52.634 --> 00:03:54.868
while they were
out chewing grass, just like --

00:03:54.868 --> 00:03:56.968
[ Laughter ]

00:03:56.968 --> 00:03:58.467
"Oh, my God.
Did you hear Dottie, Clarabelle,

00:03:58.467 --> 00:03:59.901
and Buttercup are pregnant?

00:03:59.901 --> 00:04:02.334
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:04:02.334 --> 00:04:04.167
And word is
they're all Kenny's?"

00:04:04.167 --> 00:04:08.200
[ Laughter ]

00:04:08.200 --> 00:04:09.234
"Well, can you blame them?

00:04:09.234 --> 00:04:10.734
Look at those eyes!"

00:04:10.734 --> 00:04:12.300
[ Laughter ]

00:04:12.300 --> 00:04:13.501
Also, notably, there were

00:04:13.501 --> 00:04:15.200
two other Republicans onstage
with Walker --

00:04:15.200 --> 00:04:16.934
Senators Tom Cotton
and Rick Scott.

00:04:16.934 --> 00:04:18.968
They were there to show
mainstream GOP support

00:04:18.968 --> 00:04:20.701
for Walker,
even amid all the scandals,

00:04:20.701 --> 00:04:23.601
and I can't imagine they were
hoping for that story.

00:04:23.601 --> 00:04:25.501
"Alright, Herschel,
just stay on message

00:04:25.501 --> 00:04:27.167
and talk about tax cuts
and inflation."

00:04:27.167 --> 00:04:29.400
Cool, yeah, right after
my cow sex story.

00:04:29.400 --> 00:04:30.868
[ Laughter ]
"Yeah, but maybe --

00:04:30.868 --> 00:04:32.901
maybe it's just better
to focus on inflation?"

00:04:32.901 --> 00:04:36.067
100%, but I need to warm 'em up
with the cow sex story.

00:04:36.067 --> 00:04:38.067
[ Laughter ]
"Herschel!"

00:04:38.067 --> 00:04:40.234
So, the GOP has, once again,
made a devil's bargain

00:04:40.234 --> 00:04:41.400
with Trump
and his MAGA movement.

00:04:41.400 --> 00:04:43.634
In fact, Mitch McConnell
made the bargain explicit

00:04:43.634 --> 00:04:45.467
in an interview he gave
to CNN yesterday.

00:04:45.467 --> 00:04:48.367
McConnell was asked
if he has a litmus test

00:04:48.367 --> 00:04:50.868
for Republican candidates,
then said he doesn't care

00:04:50.868 --> 00:04:53.133
who the candidates are
or what they do.

00:04:53.133 --> 00:04:54.734
He only cares about winning.

00:04:54.734 --> 00:04:57.267
-When I asked him, "Do you
prefer Republican candidates

00:04:57.267 --> 00:04:59.100
who might be
in the mold of Donald Trump;

00:04:59.100 --> 00:05:02.400
or Liz Cheney, who battled
Donald Trump's election lies;

00:05:02.400 --> 00:05:05.067
he said, "I'm for candidates
who will win

00:05:05.067 --> 00:05:08.000
and I don't have a litmus test,
one way or the other."

00:05:08.000 --> 00:05:09.000
-Trump versus Cheney,

00:05:09.000 --> 00:05:10.400
essentially asking
Leader McConnell,

00:05:10.400 --> 00:05:12.400
"Which Republican Party
would you prefer,

00:05:12.400 --> 00:05:15.334
Liz Cheney or Donald Trump?"

00:05:18.400 --> 00:05:20.400
-In a way,
I appreciate the honesty

00:05:20.400 --> 00:05:21.868
and I'm sure, as he said it,

00:05:21.868 --> 00:05:23.801
he was doing that creepy
little smile he does,

00:05:23.801 --> 00:05:26.667
you know,
like he's in that new movie.

00:05:26.667 --> 00:05:28.400
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:05:28.400 --> 00:05:30.300
McConnell and the GOP
have made it clear

00:05:30.300 --> 00:05:32.667
they don't care how badly Trump
and his cronies

00:05:32.667 --> 00:05:34.501
degrade our institution.
They just want to win,

00:05:34.501 --> 00:05:36.033
so, they're going
to keep seeking lower.

00:05:36.033 --> 00:05:38.701
I mean, they'd support
the bull from Walker's story,

00:05:38.701 --> 00:05:40.467
[ Laughter ]
if they thought
he had a chance to win.

00:05:40.467 --> 00:05:42.167
[ As McConnell ]
Oh, he explained himself.

00:05:42.167 --> 00:05:44.067
He thought the bulls
on the other side of the fence

00:05:44.067 --> 00:05:45.234
were cows.

00:05:45.234 --> 00:05:46.801
[ Laughter ]

00:05:46.801 --> 00:05:49.067
Now, you know,
his belly's all cut up.

00:05:49.067 --> 00:05:51.667
[ Laughter ]

00:05:51.667 --> 00:05:52.901
We all make mistakes."

00:05:52.901 --> 00:05:56.601
[ Laughter ]

00:05:56.601 --> 00:05:58.000
[ Applause ]
The GOP is fully behind

00:05:58.000 --> 00:05:59.367
all these Trump-backed
candidates,

00:05:59.367 --> 00:06:01.667
who are also campaigning
with Trump

00:06:01.667 --> 00:06:03.567
and appearing at his rallies,
even as Trump remains

00:06:03.567 --> 00:06:05.868
under a serious
federal criminal investigation

00:06:05.868 --> 00:06:07.634
into the highly classified
documents he stole

00:06:07.634 --> 00:06:09.567
from the White House
and stashed at Mar-A-Lago.

00:06:09.567 --> 00:06:11.934
In fact, The New York Times
just recently reported

00:06:11.934 --> 00:06:14.567
that officials suspect
Trump may still have

00:06:14.567 --> 00:06:16.601
even more documents
in his possession,

00:06:16.601 --> 00:06:18.934
that he's still not returned
to the government,

00:06:18.934 --> 00:06:20.701
in addition to the materials
the FBI

00:06:20.701 --> 00:06:22.634
has already seized
from Mar-A-Lago.

00:06:22.634 --> 00:06:24.133
-New reporting
by The New York Times,

00:06:24.133 --> 00:06:26.100
which NBC News has confirmed,

00:06:26.100 --> 00:06:28.767
reveals that the DOJ told
Trump's lawyers,

00:06:28.767 --> 00:06:29.901
in recent weeks,

00:06:29.901 --> 00:06:32.100
they believe Trump
still has more documents

00:06:32.100 --> 00:06:35.133
he has not returned
to the National Archives.

00:06:35.133 --> 00:06:36.467
The New York Times
reporting that it's...

00:06:45.033 --> 00:06:47.501
-Oh, does the
Justice Department suspect

00:06:47.501 --> 00:06:49.901
that Donald Trump may not be
fully cooperative?

00:06:49.901 --> 00:06:52.767
That's like a guy with claw
marks all over his face

00:06:52.767 --> 00:06:54.868
telling you his cat
wasn't fully cooperative

00:06:54.868 --> 00:06:56.234
with its Halloween costume.

00:06:56.234 --> 00:06:57.667
[ Laughter ]

00:06:57.667 --> 00:06:59.334
Donald Trump not being
fully cooperative

00:06:59.334 --> 00:07:01.100
with an investigation is
as shocking

00:07:01.100 --> 00:07:02.934
as the Mets winning 101 games

00:07:02.934 --> 00:07:05.400
and then blowing it in the first
round of the playoffs.

00:07:05.400 --> 00:07:07.467
[ Oohs and laughter ]
And guys, that's it!

00:07:07.467 --> 00:07:09.334
That's it for Mets jokes
this week.

00:07:09.334 --> 00:07:10.434
[ Laughter ]
Am I a Mets fan?

00:07:10.434 --> 00:07:12.300
No, I am not.
But a lot of the people

00:07:12.300 --> 00:07:14.701
who keep this show running
smoothly every day are.

00:07:14.701 --> 00:07:17.667
And I will admit that,
over the course of the season,

00:07:17.667 --> 00:07:19.701
I started rooting
for this Mets team.

00:07:19.701 --> 00:07:22.300
And, sure, they didn't win it
all, but it's pretty cool

00:07:22.300 --> 00:07:23.868
they did as well as they did,

00:07:23.868 --> 00:07:26.567
considering that, while other
teams have giant payrolls,

00:07:26.567 --> 00:07:28.701
they made it work
with a ragtag budget.

00:07:28.701 --> 00:07:30.234
What's that?

00:07:30.234 --> 00:07:32.667
[ Laughter ]
Oh, they have the highest
payroll in the league?

00:07:32.667 --> 00:07:34.033
Oh, okay.

00:07:34.033 --> 00:07:34.834
How much was it?

00:07:34.834 --> 00:07:37.200
A quarter of a billion dollars?!

00:07:37.200 --> 00:07:38.434
Oh, well, you know.

00:07:38.434 --> 00:07:39.901
Oh, I bet whoever's
inside Mr. Met

00:07:39.901 --> 00:07:41.267
is a hardworking young --

00:07:41.267 --> 00:07:43.067
Oh, it's Rudy Giuliani?!
[Bleep] me!

00:07:43.067 --> 00:07:46.133
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:07:48.834 --> 00:07:50.334
You guys, I said that was
the only Mets joke

00:07:50.334 --> 00:07:52.167
I was going to make this week.
You want to hear the real burn?

00:07:52.167 --> 00:07:53.901
I did it on Monday.
We had to cut it for time,

00:07:53.901 --> 00:07:55.534
so the crew had
to hear it twice.

00:07:55.534 --> 00:07:57.934
[ Laughter, cheering,
and applause ]

00:07:57.934 --> 00:08:00.934
And one of the crew members

00:08:00.934 --> 00:08:02.501
came up to me today
and he's like,

00:08:02.501 --> 00:08:04.200
"You're going
to [bleep] burn me twice

00:08:04.200 --> 00:08:05.934
and think I'm going to show up
tomorrow and support you?"

00:08:05.934 --> 00:08:07.634
And I'm like, "Well,
the Mets have burned you more

00:08:07.634 --> 00:08:09.167
than [bleep] twice
and you still support them."

00:08:09.167 --> 00:08:11.000
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:08:11.000 --> 00:08:15.734
And then my crew member
just tipped his cap. He said --

00:08:15.734 --> 00:08:16.501
It's a really cool thing.

00:08:16.501 --> 00:08:17.567
They all were little caps.

00:08:17.567 --> 00:08:21.868
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:08:21.868 --> 00:08:23.767
Where were we?
Oh, right.

00:08:23.767 --> 00:08:24.934
Of course Trump still has

00:08:24.934 --> 00:08:26.801
more government documents
in his possession.

00:08:26.801 --> 00:08:29.000
He's not the kind of guy
who's good at returning things.

00:08:29.000 --> 00:08:31.334
If Donald Trump borrows
your lawnmower,

00:08:31.334 --> 00:08:32.667
you're going to need to buy

00:08:32.667 --> 00:08:34.300
a new lawnmower.
[ Laughter ]

00:08:34.300 --> 00:08:35.801
I bet the copy
of "Goodnight Moon"

00:08:35.801 --> 00:08:37.200
he read his kids was stamped

00:08:37.200 --> 00:08:39.133
with Property
of New York Public Library."

00:08:39.133 --> 00:08:40.567
[ Laughter ]
Now, before we move on,

00:08:40.567 --> 00:08:41.968
which one of those was harder
for you to imagine --

00:08:41.968 --> 00:08:43.868
Donald Trump mowing a lawn all
by himself

00:08:43.868 --> 00:08:45.467
or Donald Trump reading
"Goodnight Moon"

00:08:45.467 --> 00:08:48.267
to a young Eric and Don Jr.?

00:08:48.267 --> 00:08:49.801
[ As Trump ]
"In the great green room --"

00:08:49.801 --> 00:08:50.934
And it was -- What a room.

00:08:50.934 --> 00:08:52.634
One of the greatest.
One of the greatest.

00:08:52.634 --> 00:08:54.400
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:08:54.400 --> 00:08:56.634
And just the most beautiful
mush you've ever seen.

00:08:56.634 --> 00:09:00.501
Just gorgeous, gorgeous mush,
gold-plated mush.

00:09:00.501 --> 00:09:02.534
[ Laughter ]

00:09:02.534 --> 00:09:04.534
You know why the cow is jumping
over the moon?

00:09:04.534 --> 00:09:06.501
So we could get
away from a horny bull.

00:09:06.501 --> 00:09:08.100
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:09:08.100 --> 00:09:09.968
A football player
told me that story.

00:09:09.968 --> 00:09:13.934
Point is,
even after 18 months of pleading

00:09:13.934 --> 00:09:15.901
from the National Archives,
and an FBI search,

00:09:15.901 --> 00:09:19.367
officials think this guy might
still be holding back documents

00:09:19.367 --> 00:09:20.467
that belong to the government.

00:09:20.467 --> 00:09:22.367
I can't even imagine
the sheer sense

00:09:22.367 --> 00:09:24.133
of impunity and entitlement
you have to have

00:09:24.133 --> 00:09:25.667
to just completely ignore
the law like that.

00:09:25.667 --> 00:09:27.334
One time a cop pulled me over
on the highway

00:09:27.334 --> 00:09:29.000
and I immediately
just started sobbing

00:09:29.000 --> 00:09:30.701
before I could even
roll down the window.

00:09:30.701 --> 00:09:32.634
And then he said he just wanted
to tell me my trunk was open

00:09:32.634 --> 00:09:34.100
and then I said,
"Oh, thank you so much.

00:09:34.100 --> 00:09:35.267
That's where I keep
all my meth,"

00:09:35.267 --> 00:09:36.234
[ Laughter and applause ]
because I make jokes

00:09:36.234 --> 00:09:37.400
when I'm nervous.

00:09:37.400 --> 00:09:38.934
And then he didn't even look
in the trunk.

00:09:38.934 --> 00:09:40.801
He just said,
"You don't have the balls

00:09:40.801 --> 00:09:41.634
to move crystal.

00:09:41.634 --> 00:09:42.634
Drive safely."

00:09:42.634 --> 00:09:44.801
[ Laughter and applause ]
Very rude!

00:09:44.801 --> 00:09:46.601
Uh, very rude.

00:09:46.601 --> 00:09:47.868
Now, as we told you last week,

00:09:47.868 --> 00:09:49.467
Trump appealed the ruling
in the case

00:09:49.467 --> 00:09:51.634
over his stolen documents
directly to the Supreme Court,

00:09:51.634 --> 00:09:53.601
hoping the Trump appointees
on the court

00:09:53.601 --> 00:09:56.467
would bail him out and intervene
to slow down the investigation.

00:09:56.467 --> 00:09:59.334
It just so happens the appeal
was addressed specifically

00:09:59.334 --> 00:10:00.734
to one particular justice,

00:10:00.734 --> 00:10:02.534
with a personal connection
to Trump.

00:10:02.534 --> 00:10:05.100
-Attorneys for the ex-president
made an attempt

00:10:05.100 --> 00:10:07.400
to block DOJ's
criminal investigation

00:10:07.400 --> 00:10:09.767
by asking the U.S. Supreme Court

00:10:09.767 --> 00:10:12.434
to reverse a ruling
by an appeals court

00:10:12.434 --> 00:10:13.934
that gives the DOJ access

00:10:13.934 --> 00:10:16.968
to classified documents
that were seized at Mar-A-Lago.

00:10:16.968 --> 00:10:19.267
-The justice overseeing
the 11th Circuit,

00:10:19.267 --> 00:10:21.501
whose decision
Trump is appealing,

00:10:21.501 --> 00:10:23.901
is none other
than Clarence Thomas.

00:10:23.901 --> 00:10:25.801
Now, in addition to being,
arguably,

00:10:25.801 --> 00:10:28.133
the most conservative justice
on the court,

00:10:28.133 --> 00:10:29.434
Thomas is also the husband

00:10:29.434 --> 00:10:32.300
of far-right activist
Ginni Thomas,

00:10:32.300 --> 00:10:33.467
who, in addition to pushing

00:10:33.467 --> 00:10:35.734
bonkers QAnon
conspiracy theories

00:10:35.734 --> 00:10:37.601
to Trump White House officials,

00:10:37.601 --> 00:10:40.567
also personally worked to try
and help facilitate

00:10:40.567 --> 00:10:42.067
Trump's attempted coup.

00:10:42.067 --> 00:10:45.200
-Trump must've been so psyched
when he found out the justice

00:10:45.200 --> 00:10:46.868
who would review the case
was Clarence Thomas.

00:10:46.868 --> 00:10:48.067
It's like finding out your mom

00:10:48.067 --> 00:10:49.801
started dating
your high school math teacher.

00:10:49.801 --> 00:10:51.467
"Hell yeah!

00:10:51.467 --> 00:10:52.901
[ Laughter ]
I'm going to ace this class.

00:10:52.901 --> 00:10:54.434
Doug is so horny for my mom,

00:10:54.434 --> 00:10:56.767
he told me I don't even have
to show up for exams!

00:10:56.767 --> 00:10:57.567
[ Laughter ]

00:10:57.567 --> 00:10:58.934
I feel bad for Dad, though."

00:10:58.934 --> 00:11:02.501
Yeah! In that story,
the kid's mom was still married.

00:11:02.501 --> 00:11:04.934
[ Laughter ]

00:11:04.934 --> 00:11:06.567
None of you thought about him.

00:11:06.567 --> 00:11:10.334
[ Laughter ]

00:11:10.334 --> 00:11:11.567
Everybody here should be ashamed

00:11:11.567 --> 00:11:13.501
of themselves.
[ Laughter ]

00:11:13.501 --> 00:11:14.567
Well, now,
the Justice Department

00:11:14.567 --> 00:11:15.767
has responded to that filing

00:11:15.767 --> 00:11:16.801
with a filing of its own,

00:11:16.801 --> 00:11:18.100
urging the Supreme Court to stay

00:11:18.100 --> 00:11:19.167
out of the case altogether,

00:11:19.167 --> 00:11:20.200
telling the court Trump has

00:11:20.200 --> 00:11:22.200
no legitimate ownership

00:11:22.200 --> 00:11:24.834
of any of the classified
documents under review.

00:11:24.834 --> 00:11:27.400
-The Justice Department
sending a clear message

00:11:27.400 --> 00:11:29.300
to the Supreme Court --
"Stay out

00:11:29.300 --> 00:11:31.934
of the Mar-A-Lago
documents dispute."

00:11:31.934 --> 00:11:34.200
-The Justice Department
asking the Supreme Court

00:11:34.200 --> 00:11:37.901
to reject Mr. Trump's request
that the court clear the way

00:11:37.901 --> 00:11:40.634
for the documents to be turned
over to his lawyers

00:11:40.634 --> 00:11:43.300
and a special master
for review.

00:11:43.300 --> 00:11:44.734
The Justice Department says

00:11:44.734 --> 00:11:48.400
Mr. Trump cannot make any
personal claim to the papers

00:11:48.400 --> 00:11:51.300
and has offered no evidence
he declassified them.

00:11:51.300 --> 00:11:53.734
-Yeah, I mean, it's obvious
there's no reason

00:11:53.734 --> 00:11:55.267
the Supreme Court, or any court,

00:11:55.267 --> 00:11:57.200
should step in
to delay the investigation

00:11:57.200 --> 00:11:59.901
because the classified documents
are obviously not his.

00:11:59.901 --> 00:12:02.868
Do we really need nine people
in robes to tell us

00:12:02.868 --> 00:12:05.200
if this was just stuff
he brought with him from home?

00:12:05.200 --> 00:12:07.267
Trump's acting like a guy
who got fired

00:12:07.267 --> 00:12:09.467
and then tried to leave
with the copy machine.

00:12:09.467 --> 00:12:11.234
"You guys were all here
on my first day.

00:12:11.234 --> 00:12:14.100
I had my tiny plant,
my Wayne Gretzky Bobblehead,

00:12:14.100 --> 00:12:16.033
and my industrial-size
copy machine.

00:12:16.033 --> 00:12:17.400
[ Laughter ]
You remember, Barb.

00:12:17.400 --> 00:12:19.167
You helped me wheel it in!"

00:12:19.167 --> 00:12:21.300
Remember, some of the documents
Trump stole

00:12:21.300 --> 00:12:22.434
were nuclear secrets.

00:12:22.434 --> 00:12:24.567
Are we supposed to believe
those were his

00:12:24.567 --> 00:12:26.634
and he just brought them
with him from home,

00:12:26.634 --> 00:12:28.601
like, before he was president,

00:12:28.601 --> 00:12:31.701
he was looking at aerial photos
with a magnifying lens?

00:12:31.701 --> 00:12:33.667
[ As Trump ]
Mel! Mel!

00:12:33.667 --> 00:12:35.634
I'm seeing some
very interesting images

00:12:35.634 --> 00:12:37.567
from the drone flights
I commissioned.

00:12:37.567 --> 00:12:39.133
[ Laughter ]
Mel, you're going to want

00:12:39.133 --> 00:12:40.701
to see -- Mel, Mel, honey,

00:12:40.701 --> 00:12:42.634
you have
to take out your AirPods.

00:12:42.634 --> 00:12:44.334
[ Laughter ]
Well, you can't hear --

00:12:44.334 --> 00:12:45.534
Why are you putting headphones?

00:12:45.534 --> 00:12:48.234
Mel, don't put headphones on
over the EarPods.

00:12:48.234 --> 00:12:50.400
[ Laughter ]
Oh, Mel!

00:12:50.400 --> 00:12:51.400
[ Laughter ]

00:12:51.400 --> 00:12:54.234
The various scandals engulfing

00:12:54.234 --> 00:12:56.467
Herschel Walker's campaign
and the GOP's decision

00:12:56.467 --> 00:12:57.767
to stand by him, no matter what,

00:12:57.767 --> 00:12:59.534
are just the latest examples
of how Trump

00:12:59.534 --> 00:13:01.367
has completely transformed
the GOP.

00:13:01.367 --> 00:13:03.167
Even as he remains
under multiple

00:13:03.167 --> 00:13:04.734
serious criminal investigations

00:13:04.734 --> 00:13:06.734
they remain fully captive
to Trump,

00:13:06.734 --> 00:13:09.033
a man who is much
like Herschel Walker --

00:13:09.033 --> 00:13:10.167
constantly spewing...

00:13:10.167 --> 00:13:10.934
-Bull.

00:13:10.934 --> 00:13:11.868
-This has been...

00:13:11.868 --> 00:13:13.200
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:13:13.200 --> 00:13:14.567
